{"ts":"2026-06-29T14:36:07.310Z","author":"claude-code-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-h2hk"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"pm package/extension init --capability profile: scaffold a project-profile starter package"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Add a 'profile' shape to SCAFFOLD_CAPABILITIES so pm package init / pm extension init can scaffold a starter package whose entrypoint registers a ProjectProfileDefinition through api.registerProfile (imperative) or composeExtension({ profiles: [...] }) (declarative). Mirrors the existing schema/search/renderers/etc. capability starters: manifest capability mapping (profile -> [commands, schema] since a profile registration requires the schema capability), per-capability README sections, define* guidance snippet (defineProjectProfile), colocated node:test using the harness assertProfile helper, declarative blueprint surface + test block, and conservative activation (omit activation.commands like schema so pm profile list/show/apply can resolve the contributed profile). Update completion (bash/zsh/fish via SCAFFOLD_CAPABILITIES interpolation), register-setup help text, cli-contracts/full.json, and EXTENSIONS.md/SDK.md."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:extensions","area:profile","dx","living-map","pm-cli","scaffold"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-06-29T14:36:07.310Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-06-29T14:36:07.310Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"claude-code-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"pm package init --capability profile and pm extension init --capability profile both emit a runnable starter that registers a project profile via api.registerProfile (imperative) and composeExtension blueprint.profiles (declarative); the colocated index.test.ts asserts the profile registration via the harness and passes preflight; derived capabilities resolve to [commands, schema]; completion + register-setup + cli-contracts + docs updated; 100% test + docstring coverage; manual e2e proves pm profile list/show/apply surfaces the scaffolded profile"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"project management = context management"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"An author can scaffold a complete, runnable project-profile package in one command, completing the profile authoring lifecycle (define → register → compose → derive → describe → test → scaffold)"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"Extension-contributed profiles shipped in #401/#402 (api.registerProfile) but the scaffolder had no --capability profile starter — the only registration surface without one; profiles are the broadest customization primitive, so the gap blocked the easiest on-ramp for new archetype packages"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-ugqx"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"91777817a2cc8b2e8481218e06969fbbb8e3ebcaa5423ec538eb7f83737fc66a","message":""}
